      "writtenOn": "2021-03-10T03:32:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I wonder if this and the functions it calls could be parameterizable at the cc_library_static module\u0027s bazel handler level, instead of being so central in the bazel_handler.go?\n\nMoving forward, we probably want to co-locate these cquery logic closer to the bazel handler that\u0027s requesting for them.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 532,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 532,
        "endChar": 109
      },
      "revId": "f6481066bdd5d858e8cea71d2e390a9f47a35d02",
